: [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}], "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 257404, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Hw4cqPdbtw9ScVhexsyUja", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 257404, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Hw4cqPdbtw9ScVhexsyUja", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 262533, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YFcwitbjoWTbnp5YqHvwBA", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 262833, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YFcwitbjoWTbnp5YqHvwBA", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 262833, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YFcwitbjoWTbnp5YqHvwBA", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 265702, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UouuvAsvU9ZsUQyf8A1CvU", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 622833, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UouuvAsvU9ZsUQyf8A1CvU", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 622833, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UouuvAsvU9ZsUQyf8A1CvU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 628288, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01SMUwWgAsLjeXK9rhcqZ57d", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding (FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` even though its docstring says ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\nChange: switch `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- `2.675 -> 2.68`, `2.665 -> 2.66` (previously 2.67)\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.\n\nNote: this changes rounding for any amount that ends exactly on a half cent, so it may affect downstream totals.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 659188, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01SMUwWgAsLjeXK9rhcqZ57d", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 659188, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01SMUwWgAsLjeXK9rhcqZ57d", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 662132, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Bogg8MjH8yduh15BX8Ayab", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 662432, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Bogg8MjH8yduh15BX8Ayab", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 662432, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Bogg8MjH8yduh15BX8Ayab", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 665398, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01DUUnW5hT2KM1qZdabMYhFX", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.94}, "confidence": 0.94}, {"t_ms": 665698, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01DUUnW5hT2KM1qZdabMYhFX", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 665698, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DUUnW5hT2KM1qZdabMYhFX", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 672353, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says it should use banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). The test expects `2.665` to round to `2.66`, but the code gave `2.67`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-bankers-rounding`, I switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That was the only change.\n- **CI:** The test run (ci-0001) passed on the fix commit (`08d3cd5986`).\n- **Pull request:** The request to open the PR timed out, so I checked the open PRs before trying again. PR #101 had been created, but with no reviewers, so I added alex rather than opening a second one.\n\nI didn't merge it, since merging into main needs code-owner approval. Amounts that land exactly on a half cent will now round differently, which could slightly change totals elsewhere. I mentioned this in the PR description.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the relevant files and the advisory.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RmNMYRpxxd7SetUEmoNTWG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YCiGpZUhSLMneZEBDz3S5R", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WeWK7NKdaeQUQMpzmGpB59", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212", "confidence": 0.7}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SCrvKn4TyG4WczroZcTSKM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Hw4cqPdbtw9ScVhexsyUja", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money, per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}], "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01YFcwitbjoWTbnp5YqHvwBA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-money-bankers-rounding-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UouuvAsvU9ZsUQyf8A1CvU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the fix commit. Opening the PR:", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SMUwWgAsLjeXK9rhcqZ57d", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/money-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212", "body": "The nightly build was failing because `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` expects banker's rounding (FIN-212), but `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` even though its docstring says ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\nChange: switch `round_money` to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n- `2.675 -> 2.68`, `2.665 -> 2.66` (previously 2.67)\n\nCI: ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.\n\nNote: this changes rounding for any amount that ends exactly on a half cent, so it may affect downstream totals.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.93}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, but the PR might still have been created. I'll check before retrying so I don't open a duplicate.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Bogg8MjH8yduh15BX8Ayab", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_prs", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "PR #101 was created despite the timeout, but no reviewers are on it. Adding alex:", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DUUnW5hT2KM1qZdabMYhFX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.94}, "name": "request_review", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says it should use banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). The test expects `2.665` to round to `2.66`, but the code gave `2.67`.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-bankers-rounding`, I switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That was the only change.\n- **CI:** The test run (ci-0001) passed on the fix commit (`08d3cd5986`).\n- **Pull request:** The request to open the PR timed out, so I checked the open PRs before trying again. PR #101 had been created, but with no reviewers, so I added alex rather than opening a second one.\n\nI didn't merge it, since merging into main needs code-owner approval. Amounts that land exactly on a half cent will now round differently, which could slightly change totals elsewhere. I mentioned this in the PR description.", "type": "text"}]}]}